{
  "_comment": "Changelog art. Sources live in site/art/ (Codex, text-free, SLIP drawn from art/slip-sheet.png), scripts/changelog-art.mjs snaps them to the brand palette and writes AVIF, WebP, a thumbnail and a blurred placeholder for each into public/changelog-art/. Every release has its own three-panel strip (before, shipped, reaction) on the left page; a release with no strip yet shows its version big and loads no image. Titles are optional; without one the first entry is the title. All words on the art are overlay items drawn as HTML: sfx (crimson sound word), bubble (speech), tag (ink caption); x and y are the item's centre in percent of the art, r degrees, s a size factor, w a width in percent.",
